<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Today's <%= kindOfDay %>
    </title>
</head>

<body>
    <h1>Welcome to the <%= kindOfDay %> page!</h1>
    <p>Today is a <%= kindOfDay %>. And since it's <% if (kindOfDay==="Saturday" || kindOfDay==="Sunday" ) { %>
                a weekend day! You Should Relax! 😌
                <% } else { %>
                    a weekday. You have to work! 💼
                    <% } %>
    </p>

</body>

</html>